1
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:37,000
Chief, we've verified everything.

2
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:38,400
Among those three men,

3
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,879
Yang Mingwei and Li Hao,

4
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,560
these two do have relatives

5
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:43,280
working at Luxury Home Decoration.

6
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,519
But they didn't participate in the Elite Club

7
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,120
project.

8
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,120
The focus is on that Wang Ping'an.

9
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,239
His so-called relative

10
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:53,480
is Wan Shenghao from Luxury Home Decoration,

11
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,719
the boss who ran away.

12
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,400
That's him.

13
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,480
I heard from the workers

14
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:00,000
that these three knew each other before.

15
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,040
The Labor Bureau also contacted us,

16
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,280
saying Elite Club

17
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,959
indeed hasn't paid the project funds in full,

18
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,840
but it's still within the contract period.

19
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,319
There's no malicious wage default.

20
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,879
So based on the current situation,

21
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:13,639
it's highly possible they intentionally caused trouble.

22
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,159
Chief Ji,

23
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,439
should we report this to the higher-ups?

24
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,000
Because of this matter, Chief Liao

25
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,800
is being targeted by Internal Affairs.

26
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,840
What did Wang Ping'an say?

27
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,319
Wang Ping'an is an old fox.

28
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,439
He firmly insists

29
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,080
that Wan Shenghao owes him money too,

30
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,120
and he's just here to demand his wages.

31
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,520
Don't worry, Chief.

32
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,080
I'll figure out a way to make him talk.

33
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:38,520
No need.

34
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,240
I'll interrogate Wang Ping'an myself.

35
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,319
Wan Shenghao is your cousin.

36
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,159
Right.

37
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,639
Does that matter?

38
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,400
Even brothers keep clear accounts.

39
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:17,919
He owes money, I collect it.

40
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:18,879
It's only natural.

41
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:19,919
Wouldn't you say so?

42
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,240
Yes, a distant cousin.

43
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,719
You weren't part of the Elite Club project.

44
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:27,759
Why did you go there to demand wages?

45
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:30,080
Wan Shenghao owes me money.

46
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,360
Elite Club owes Wan Shenghao money.

47
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:33,560
Nothing wrong with me asking them for it, right?

48
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,039
How did you know Elite Club owed money?

49
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:36,960
Wan Shenghao told me.

50
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,759
You just took his word for it?

51
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,759
We saw the contract.

52
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:41,400
We?

53
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,439
Who else besides you?

54
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:47,360
Sixty-three workers were there demanding wages.

55
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,560
But only you saw the contract.

56
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Aren't you special.

57
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,800
We are relatives, after all.

58
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,879
Elite Club's final payment

59
00:03:58,199 --> 00:03:59,400
hasn't reached its due date yet.

60
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:00,960
It should be written in the contract.

61
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,680
Didn't you see it?

62
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:05,639
Well...

63
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,639
I really didn't notice that.

64
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,439
I just knew they owed money.

65
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,960
Do you know the consequences of assaulting a police officer?

66
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:15,759
I didn't assault a police officer!

67
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,879
That was purely an accident.

68
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:18,399
Just tell me, do you know?

69
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,079
I'm not sure.

70
00:04:27,079 --> 00:04:28,079
Under normal circumstances,

71
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,600
violently assaulting

72
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:32,160
a police officer performing their lawful duties,

73
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,600
according to the Criminal Law,

74
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,879
will result in criminal liability

75
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,000
and severe punishment.

76
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:37,560
Is that clear?

77
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,319
Listen to me.

78
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,319
I don't have time to give you a law lesson.

79
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:00,959
I've got a lot on my plate.

80
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,079
Either you tell me what's going on right now

81
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:03,959
and come clean with me,

82
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,439
or you wait until we track down Wan Shenghao,

83
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:08,720
and you two brothers can confront each other.

84
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,319
Let me warn you, though.

85
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,040
By then,

86
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,800
if you want to clear your name,

87
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,079
you won't get the chance.

88
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:36,279
Haven't seen you around lately.

89
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,040
I was on a business trip.

90
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,279
I went on a business trip last month.

91
00:06:00,639 --> 00:06:01,800
I noted down the utility readings.

92
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,519
I wasn't home for the whole month.

93
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:04,680
But the meters kept running.

94
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,480
Someone definitely stayed in my house.

95
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,079
Are you sure?

96
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,079
I'm sure.

97
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,000
Plus, I have certain habits.

98
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:11,879
Every time I leave the house,

99
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,439
I leave my toothbrush at an angle.

100
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,879
But now it's standing straight.

101
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,879
A-And my slippers.

102
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,399
I remember they faced inward, but now they face outward.

103
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:24,480
The blanket was laid flat when I left.

104
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,319
It wasn't this messy.

105
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:29,079
I remember the duvet cover zipper was facing down.

106
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:31,079
But now the zipper is facing the pillows.

107
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:03,160
Notify Criminal Investigation and Narcotics.

108
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,160
Yes, sir.

109
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,040
Chief Zhang.

110
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,399
Take a sample.

111
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:22,639
On it.

112
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:25,360
Did you find something?

113
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,399
Looks like traces of drugs.

114
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,240
Search this room.

115
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:10,920
Fingerprints?

116
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:11,480
Yes.

117
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:17,720
Did you check over there?

118
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:18,759
I did.

119
00:08:18,879 --> 00:08:19,519
Nothing unusual.

120
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,360
Nothing unusual here either.

121
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,879
Check this smart doorbell.

122
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,919
It might have recorded what we need.

123
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:41,639
Yes, sir.

124
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,360
As for the two fugitives

125
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:46,159
of the Luzhong Murder Case,

126
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,519
we finally have a clear lead.

127
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:48,840
First,

128
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,440
the forensics department analyzed

129
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:53,039
the fingerprints collected in the studio apartment,

130
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,679
and they match the fingerprints collected

131
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,440
at the Luzhong crime scene.

132
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:57,559
This is very likely...

133
00:08:59,759 --> 00:09:00,200
Well,

134
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,919
these were definitely left by the suspects

135
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,200
when picking up their takeout,

136
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,000
completely by accident.

137
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,039
Second,

138
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,519
from the footage captured by a

139
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:11,279
smart lock camera across from

140
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,759
the studio apartment,

141
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:15,039
we extracted their physical features.

142
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,879
Confirmed by the Ministry of Public Security and Interpol,

143
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:20,000
they are fugitives

144
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,440
from overseas.

145
00:09:21,879 --> 00:09:24,000
The one on the left is Shuahai,

146
00:09:24,759 --> 00:09:25,399
the brains of the gang.

147
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:28,080
The one on the right is Heihai,

148
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,039
the muscle of the gang.

149
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,919
This explains

150
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,399
why their fingerprint samples

151
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,240
yielded no matches.

152
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,639
Any entry records?

153
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,440
No.

154
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,879
They definitely didn't enter legally.

155
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:44,240
Fugitives from overseas

156
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,320
coming to Hongye,

157
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,600
coupled with the drug residue

158
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,720
repeatedly found at the crime scenes...

159
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,519
We can conclude

160
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,000
their entry into the country

161
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,200
is tied to Spring Snow.

162
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:54,960
Also, in other provinces and cities,

163
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:57,200
the circulation of Spring Snow has dropped sharply.

164
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:58,440
We suspect

165
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,919
this is a factor for their arrival in Hongye.

166
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
That's strange.

167
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,000
Coming to Hongye at this time...

168
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,000
Could there be a problem with their supply?

169
00:10:15,639 --> 00:10:16,720
Whether there's a supply issue or not,

170
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,639
we don't know for sure.

171
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:19,240
But we can use this lead

172
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,399
to track down the source of Spring Snow.

173
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,799
I hate hearing you say

174
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:26,600
that you don't know this or that.

175
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:27,919
When will you know for sure?

176
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,440
Chief Guo,

177
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,320
our Economic Crime Investigation Unit is clear on this.

178
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,840
Through abnormal capital flows

179
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,440
and Lang Tao's transaction history,

180
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:37,919
we found

181
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,559
an overseas account suspected of money laundering.

182
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:42,440
We will continue the investigation.

183
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:44,000
Once we have any leads,

184
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,759
I'll report to you immediately.

185
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,480
These two guys

186
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,039
have operated together for a long time.

187
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,480
They're cunning and ruthless.

188
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,519
They have strong counter-reconnaissance awareness.

189
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,679
I think even if they barely touched down,

190
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:10,360
they must have left some clues behind.

191
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:11,279
Let's do this.

192
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,200
We need a different approach.

193
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:15,000
Go back to square one

194
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,519
and check again.

195
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,840
Yes, sir.

196
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,399
Girls, hurry up.

197
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:34,600
You're all so slow.

198
00:11:34,679 --> 00:11:35,399
They're all waiting.

199
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,279
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

200
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:38,440
Manda.

201
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:39,200
What?

202
00:11:39,399 --> 00:11:40,679
Is this the only dress you have?

203
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:42,919
My skirt is already short enough.

204
00:11:43,799 --> 00:11:45,159
Who do you see working here

205
00:11:45,159 --> 00:11:46,519
covered up this much?

206
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,399
Unzip it.

207
00:11:48,279 --> 00:11:49,840
If you're hustling, don't be a prude.

208
00:11:50,159 --> 00:11:51,120
There's no such easy money.

209
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:54,519
Sorry about that.

210
00:11:54,519 --> 00:11:55,879
Sorry for the wait, bosses.

211
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:00,519
Come on, line up, line up.

212
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,559
Say hello to the bosses.

213
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,240
Good evening, bosses.

214
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,159
Gentlemen,

215
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,360
take a look at our girls.

216
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,840
Pick a couple if you see anyone you like.

217
00:12:15,039 --> 00:12:16,080
Boss,

218
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,720
dice are nowhere near as fun as our girls.

219
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,159
Come on, pick one.

220
00:12:21,279 --> 00:12:21,600
Big.

221
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:27,840
Number six, stay.

222
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:30,919
Come on, Manda.

223
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,639
Quick.

224
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:44,440
That online stuff about the Special Police Unit was your doing, right?

225
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:46,279
What about it?

226
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:48,399
Are you worried about him?

227
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:49,720
You misunderstand.

228
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:52,679
You've got it wrong too.

229
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,480
It's just a coincidence.

230
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,480
I wouldn't try to ruin him

231
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:58,279
by risking my own business.

232
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:59,080
You don't need to explain it to me.

233
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:01,559
I'm calling just to warn you.

234
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,279
Stop causing trouble.

235
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,039
Keep a low profile.

236
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,240
Careful not to get burned playing with fire.

237
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,039
If you go down, that's fine.

238
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,399
Just don't drag me and Naonao into it.

239
00:13:31,519 --> 00:13:33,159
Boss Lu! Boss Lu!

240
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:35,120
They...

241
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:36,440
They're here!

242
00:15:12,559 --> 00:15:13,559
I'm sorry.

243
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:16,600
I got your place dirty again.

244
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,480
You don't know what's good for you.

245
00:15:33,159 --> 00:15:34,759
Time and time again.

246
00:15:39,799 --> 00:15:40,919
What do you take me for?

247
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,399
A dead man?

248
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,840
I warned you.

249
00:15:49,679 --> 00:15:50,960
If you won't let me take them,

250
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,240
either you die,

251
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,240
or I do.

252
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,240
What are you betting against me?

253
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:05,679
Two worthless lives.

254
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,039
Wanna play?

255
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,159
Play.

256
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,200
Come on.

257
00:16:31,159 --> 00:16:32,480
Let's play.

258
00:16:34,879 --> 00:16:35,960
Let's play together.

259
00:16:36,639 --> 00:16:37,720
Come play with us.

260
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:48,840
Okay.

261
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,240
I'll count to three.

262
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,399
We'll go together.

263
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:56,480
One.

264
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:00,960
Two.

265
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:04,519
Dayong.

266
00:17:16,039 --> 00:17:17,599
The underworld isn't all about fighting and killing.

267
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,000
Put the gun down.

268
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:22,400
Drop it.

269
00:17:29,039 --> 00:17:29,680
You wanna play?

270
00:17:30,359 --> 00:17:31,319
Keep playing!

271
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:46,920
This is so boring.

272
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,920
I'm just a businessman.

273
00:18:21,119 --> 00:18:22,319
Don't do this over a woman.

274
00:18:23,319 --> 00:18:25,319
It's not worth fighting to the death.

275
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,680
It's just business.

276
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,799
Everything is negotiable.

277
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:33,200
Don't you agree?

278
00:18:37,599 --> 00:18:38,559
I'm done playing.

279
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,279
Bro.

280
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,720
How about this?

281
00:19:24,119 --> 00:19:24,759
The boat,

282
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,640
I'll give it to you two.

283
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,960
I... I'll just get off.

284
00:19:34,039 --> 00:19:35,480
If you won't go alive,

285
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,720
then we'll take you dead.

286
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:47,160
I... I want to go!

287
00:19:47,759 --> 00:19:48,799
How could I not?

288
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:51,000
I... I was just afraid of being a burden to you two.

289
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,799
I only know how to drive a boat.

290
00:19:53,039 --> 00:19:54,880
But I'm pretty good at it, right?

291
00:19:56,599 --> 00:19:57,640
I'm a really good driver.

292
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,839
Get the stuff ready.

293
00:20:00,799 --> 00:20:01,440
Wait for my call.

294
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:19,640
Boss!

295
00:20:23,799 --> 00:20:24,119
Boss!

296
00:20:24,839 --> 00:20:26,759
Me? I'm just a lowly fisherman.

297
00:20:27,039 --> 00:20:29,160
Those two wolf cubs are a foreign breed.

298
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,759
They don't play by our rules here.

299
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:01,359
Look at me.

300
00:21:07,039 --> 00:21:07,440
Don't be afraid.

301
00:21:10,359 --> 00:21:11,400
Make sure they're all in order

302
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,799
to board the boat safely.

303
00:21:14,799 --> 00:21:15,000
Got it.

304
00:21:18,359 --> 00:21:18,880
Then...

305
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:21,640
Understood.

306
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,559
Good boy.

307
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:48,920
Let's go grab a bite.

308
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:51,480
I don't have an appetite.

309
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:53,880
He's just too stubborn.

310
00:21:54,559 --> 00:21:55,279
There's no talking him out of it.

311
00:21:56,079 --> 00:21:56,559
Who are you talking about?

312
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:58,440
Who else? Chief Liao.

313
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:01,039
You went to see him?

314
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:02,599
I tried talking to him for ages.

315
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:04,079
It didn't do any good.

316
00:22:07,359 --> 00:22:08,359
Stop trying to talk to him.

317
00:22:10,319 --> 00:22:12,319
The earth won't stop spinning without him.

318
00:22:13,839 --> 00:22:15,799
I think he's bottling up a lot of frustration.

319
00:22:15,799 --> 00:22:16,480
I get it.

320
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,119
He feels he didn't do anything wrong.

321
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:21,400
But now the whole internet is cursing him.

322
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:22,559
And he's being investigated.

323
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:24,519
He's obviously upset right now.

324
00:22:25,039 --> 00:22:26,880
We just need to clear this up quickly.

325
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,799
Prove he didn't do anything wrong.

326
00:22:28,799 --> 00:22:29,720
Then the issue will be resolved.

327
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:32,279
Internal Affairs is investigating now.

328
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,720
Those few guys we arrested

329
00:22:35,319 --> 00:22:36,279
must be up to something.

330
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:40,200
But it's hard to define the nature of it right now.

331
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,960
It takes time.

332
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:47,599
Right now, this investigation

333
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,920
and how fast it progresses

334
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:50,480
depends entirely on Chief Ji.

335
00:22:51,599 --> 00:22:52,039
How so?

336
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,720
What's your status like at home?

337
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:56,279
High.

338
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:57,480
Then you're doing better than me.

339
00:23:03,359 --> 00:23:04,359
Yellow peaches.

340
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:09,599
This has no additives, you can eat it.

341
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:12,400
It doesn't say that here.

342
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:15,319
I eat at the cafeteria at work.

343
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,759
I come home to a fridge full of food.

344
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,440
I don't have a chance to eat snacks.

345
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:21,039
When work gets busy,

346
00:23:21,359 --> 00:23:22,279
you just grab a quick bite.

347
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:25,839
This has no additives.

348
00:23:28,279 --> 00:23:29,960
I also restocked a bunch of new snacks at home.

349
00:23:31,319 --> 00:23:32,880
Liao Bufan has been on leave recently.

350
00:23:33,599 --> 00:23:35,079
I have to stay rooted at the Special Police Unit.

351
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:36,640
I won't have time to take care of you.

352
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:38,799
Take good care of yourself, okay?

353
00:23:40,599 --> 00:23:41,400
Even before he went on leave,

354
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:43,440
you were already rooted at the Special Police Unit.

355
00:23:45,279 --> 00:23:47,079
You wouldn't be this attentive without a reason.

356
00:23:47,759 --> 00:23:48,200
Out with it.

357
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:49,640
What's going on?

358
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:53,599
"Attentive" isn't exactly the right word.

359
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,640
This is love.

360
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:59,400
Did Liao Bufan mishandle things?

361
00:24:02,799 --> 00:24:04,079
Based on the current evidence,

362
00:24:05,119 --> 00:24:06,240
those few guys definitely have issues.

363
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:09,279
They took orders from the boss of Luxury Home Decoration

364
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,640
to deliberately incite the workers to cause trouble.

365
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:13,319
They just wanted to blow things out of proportion

366
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:16,400
to force Elite Club to compromise and pay up.

367
00:24:19,039 --> 00:24:20,880
Then I need to go see Old Guo.

368
00:24:22,039 --> 00:24:23,720
To have him drop the

369
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:26,000
internal investigation into Liao Bufan.

370
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,880
The files have already been sent to the city bureau.

371
00:24:29,279 --> 00:24:30,640
The cancellation order will come down soon.

372
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:33,559
That's great.

373
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:35,559
Good.

374
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:41,240
Why are you looking at me like that?

375
00:24:43,079 --> 00:24:44,640
I didn't expect you to care about him.

376
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:49,359
This kid has a bit of a bad temper,

377
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:51,799
but you have to admit,

378
00:24:52,119 --> 00:24:52,960
he's quite responsible.

379
00:24:54,279 --> 00:24:54,960
That's something

380
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,279
I need to learn from him.

381
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,240
Yeah.

382
00:25:00,079 --> 00:25:02,039
Regarding Elite Club,

383
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:06,880
I really failed to keep the situation under control.

384
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:10,759
That was my fault.

385
00:25:16,799 --> 00:25:17,720
I was at fault that day too.

386
00:25:18,799 --> 00:25:20,079
I didn't control my emotions well.

387
00:25:28,279 --> 00:25:29,640
You've taken good care of these flowers.

388
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:33,240
I just water them whenever I remember.

389
00:25:34,079 --> 00:25:35,359
I didn't expect them to bloom like this.

390
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:41,000
Flowers are like relationships.

391
00:25:42,079 --> 00:25:43,680
If it's the right person, anything works.

392
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,960
Do you know what the Marguerite's flower language is?

393
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,279
I heard from Wang Yunsheng

394
00:26:01,480 --> 00:26:04,039
that when you went to the range for confidence shooting,

395
00:26:05,359 --> 00:26:06,440
you broke your watch.

396
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:14,119
Why does this kid blab about everything?

397
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:16,720
For me?

398
00:26:19,599 --> 00:26:20,720
A smartwatch.

399
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:24,960
It must be expensive, right?

400
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,799
What's the Marguerite's flower language?

401
00:26:37,119 --> 00:26:38,200
The wife is always right.

402
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:40,480
Love the wife.

403
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,519
Love the family.

404
00:27:00,079 --> 00:27:00,640
Ma'am.

405
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:01,920
Don't be nervous.

406
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,759
We're here to say goodbye.

407
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:05,960
Boss Lu said

408
00:27:06,319 --> 00:27:07,519
there's no need for us

409
00:27:07,519 --> 00:27:08,480
to stay here with you anymore.

410
00:27:09,519 --> 00:27:10,279
The lease is canceled.

411
00:27:11,119 --> 00:27:11,960
So we'll be heading out.

412
00:27:14,599 --> 00:27:15,160
Goodbye, Ma'am.

413
00:27:16,559 --> 00:27:17,079
Goodbye, Naonao.

414
00:27:36,880 --> 00:27:38,720
We checked the surveillance footage at the pier.

415
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,720
Er Hai was seen there.

416
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,400
So we currently suspect

417
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:44,880
he entered the country illegally on a fishing boat.

418
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,079
We also re-verified

419
00:27:47,079 --> 00:27:48,480
all of Jin Yonggang's information.

420
00:27:48,799 --> 00:27:50,480
We found that before the incident,

421
00:27:50,759 --> 00:27:52,160
he had contacted a fisherman named Pei Jianguo,

422
00:27:52,359 --> 00:27:54,279
nicknamed Pei Laosan.

423
00:27:54,599 --> 00:27:55,400
This Pei Laosan

424
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,559
owns his own fishing boat

425
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:57,880
and often goes out to sea.

426
00:27:58,400 --> 00:27:59,640
He has the means to cross the border.

427
00:28:01,519 --> 00:28:02,400
On our end,

428
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:05,440
we investigated Pei Laosan's bank account

429
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:07,920
and indeed found a deposit

430
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,279
of 100,000 yuan.

431
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:11,359
The time of this deposit

432
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:13,400
was the day before the Luzhong Murder Case.

433
00:28:14,319 --> 00:28:17,799
It's highly likely this is the dirty money paid to Pei Laosan

434
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,480
for assisting Er Hai's illegal entry.

435
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:22,400
I said it's highly likely.

436
00:28:28,759 --> 00:28:29,720
I-In other words,

437
00:28:30,359 --> 00:28:32,759
Pei Laosan is the one who helped Er Hai

438
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:34,519
smuggle into the country.

439
00:28:35,319 --> 00:28:36,680
He is also the middleman who introduced

440
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,319
Er Hai to Jin Yonggang.

441
00:28:39,279 --> 00:28:39,839
Keep a close eye on him.

442
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,119
He applied to leave port tomorrow.

443
00:28:43,319 --> 00:28:44,039
It's highly likely

444
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:49,240
he's illegally smuggling these two out of the country.

445
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:56,359
Organize a joint operation.

446
00:28:57,119 --> 00:28:58,279
Notify the Special Police Unit and Coast Guard

447
00:28:58,480 --> 00:28:58,960
to assist.

448
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,160
Make sure nothing goes wrong this time.

449
00:29:01,559 --> 00:29:02,400
Yes, understood.

450
00:29:06,039 --> 00:29:06,519
Look at this.

451
00:29:07,279 --> 00:29:08,119
Once this announcement was released,

452
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,519
the tide turned.

453
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:13,200
People are lining up to apologize in the comments.

454
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:15,839
I know I did nothing wrong.

455
00:29:21,319 --> 00:29:22,400
The truth is finally out.

456
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:24,200
Shouldn't your sick leave be over by now?

457
00:29:26,119 --> 00:29:27,119
Not quite yet.

458
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:28,960
Let's wait a bit longer.

459
00:29:33,119 --> 00:29:35,039
The official announcement is already out.

460
00:29:35,599 --> 00:29:38,359
Dropping the investigation is just a matter of days.

461
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,680
An announcement is one thing,

462
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:45,680
an investigation is another.

463
00:29:46,279 --> 00:29:46,880
They're two different things.

464
00:29:55,279 --> 00:29:55,720
Speaking.

465
00:29:58,119 --> 00:29:59,599
Okay, okay, got it.

466
00:30:03,119 --> 00:30:05,319
The municipal bureau wants us in a meeting tomorrow.

467
00:30:07,319 --> 00:30:08,400
There might be a big operation.

468
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:10,480
You go then.

469
00:30:11,839 --> 00:30:12,839
I'll wait for the investigation results.

470
00:30:17,079 --> 00:30:18,319
Can we eat this red one?

471
00:30:18,319 --> 00:30:18,640
Don't touch it.

472
00:30:21,079 --> 00:30:21,839
We don't have many red fruits this year.

473
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,359
Leave professional work to the professionals.

474
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,880
Aren't you going to wash up?

475
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:39,960
Not going to sleep?

476
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:41,720
I'll go in a bit.

477
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,319
What are you brooding over?

478
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:56,400
Did you get scolded?

479
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:58,920
If only it were just that.

480
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:03,519
The merit awards for Dai Mingming's case are out.

481
00:31:04,720 --> 00:31:05,519
What's the result?

482
00:31:07,079 --> 00:31:07,720
Third-class merit.

483
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:10,359
That's great. A third-class merit.

484
00:31:10,599 --> 00:31:12,440
Now you're qualified to become a formal officer.

485
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:13,960
You better start preparing for the exam.

486
00:31:15,839 --> 00:31:16,720
A collective third-class merit.

487
00:31:18,839 --> 00:31:19,880
A collective third-class merit?

488
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,119
Who else even helped with the rescue?

489
00:31:25,759 --> 00:31:27,160
The Municipal Bureau said this case

490
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:28,839
is very complicated,

491
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,480
and its nature is unique.

492
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:32,880
The rescue itself

493
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,079
is hard to define.

494
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,960
So they awarded the station a collective merit.

495
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:39,240
As for me personally,

496
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,079
no commendation for now.

497
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:47,200
What did Chief Ji say?

498
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,799
Chief Ji can't do anything about it either.

499
00:31:51,279 --> 00:31:52,079
She just said

500
00:31:53,880 --> 00:31:56,519
she'd try to fight for a bigger bonus for me.

501
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,279
I think I understand.

502
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:03,839
Well...

503
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:06,799
Don't let this weigh on you.

504
00:32:08,559 --> 00:32:09,599
The leaders' decisions

505
00:32:09,599 --> 00:32:11,599
have to take all aspects into account.

506
00:32:13,279 --> 00:32:13,839
You'll still have chances.

507
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:18,559
Commissar Tan.

508
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,200
I get the logic.

509
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:23,680
And I understand.

510
00:32:27,079 --> 00:32:28,559
I just feel like I'm letting my family down.

511
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:32,160
People in my hometown

512
00:32:32,839 --> 00:32:34,680
all think I'm a formal police officer.

513
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:37,680
My parents are especially proud of that.

514
00:32:38,519 --> 00:32:39,920
Every time I go back,

515
00:32:40,559 --> 00:32:42,160
they tell all the neighbors, saying,

516
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:44,480
"Look, my son is a cop."

517
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,839
Actually, every time I see them,

518
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:50,680
I want to tell them

519
00:32:53,279 --> 00:32:55,880
that I'm just an auxiliary cop.

520
00:32:58,119 --> 00:32:59,839
But whenever I see the look in their eyes,

521
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,000
the way they look at me,

522
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:04,079
I just can't bring myself to say it.

523
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,279
I really, really want

524
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:12,519
to truly be someone they can be proud of.

525
00:33:15,880 --> 00:33:17,119
I'm turning 30 soon.

526
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:18,880
I'll be over the age limit.

527
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:22,279
I won't be able to become a formal officer.

528
00:33:26,160 --> 00:33:27,960
This was probably my last chance.

529
00:33:39,599 --> 00:33:41,359
May the world be free from illness,

530
00:33:43,599 --> 00:33:46,759
even if the medicine on the shelves gathers dust.

531
00:33:52,119 --> 00:33:53,359
We shouldn't rush for quick results.

532
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:15,800
Uncle Liao! Uncle Liao!

533
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:16,360
Bring it here.

534
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:23,280
Chief Liao is here.

535
00:34:24,639 --> 00:34:25,519
What are you playing?

536
00:34:26,599 --> 00:34:27,920
I wanted to talk to you about something.

537
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:31,000
I'll take him to Ms. Chen's tomorrow.

538
00:34:31,920 --> 00:34:33,400
Because I won't have time later on.

539
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:35,519
Okay, okay.

540
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:38,719
Vacation's over?

541
00:34:40,239 --> 00:34:42,360
I saw the Hongye Police briefing.

542
00:34:42,400 --> 00:34:44,039
It said the public order issue is resolved.

543
00:34:45,239 --> 00:34:45,920
It's fine.

544
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:48,599
True.

545
00:34:49,159 --> 00:34:50,320
There are still many people

546
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,440
who support and trust you.

547
00:34:53,039 --> 00:34:54,039
Uncle Liao,

548
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:55,559
don't be sad.

549
00:34:55,719 --> 00:34:58,079
If you're not happy, Mom's not happy.

550
00:34:58,079 --> 00:34:59,559
And Naonao's not happy either.

551
00:35:01,599 --> 00:35:03,480
What makes you think I'm not happy?

552
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,719
Is it because I'm not smiling?

553
00:35:09,199 --> 00:35:10,920
Alright then. I'll pick you guys up tomorrow.

554
00:35:11,079 --> 00:35:12,079
Thanks for your help tomorrow.

555
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:13,119
Bye.

556
00:35:13,119 --> 00:35:13,480
Bye.

557
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:13,840
Say bye to Uncle Liao.

558
00:35:14,119 --> 00:35:15,800
Bye. Good night, Uncle Liao.

559
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:16,679
Bye.

560
00:35:17,159 --> 00:35:17,639
Bye.

561
00:35:19,559 --> 00:35:21,320
Alright, you'll see Uncle Liao again tomorrow.

562
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:21,880
Let's go. Let's go.

563
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:30,920
Set up a perimeter here.

564
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:31,519
You're here too.

565
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:32,920
This supermarket...

566
00:35:34,519 --> 00:35:35,280
Pass these out, pass these out.

567
00:35:37,719 --> 00:35:39,920
Spill it. What's this big operation about?

568
00:35:41,079 --> 00:35:42,159
You'll find out after the meeting.

569
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:44,360
Get outta here. Go sit over there.

570
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:44,960
Chief Guo.

571
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:46,679
Chief Guo.

572
00:35:47,199 --> 00:35:47,599
Chief Guo.

573
00:35:48,599 --> 00:35:49,039
Have a seat. Sit down.

574
00:35:49,599 --> 00:35:50,199
Well...

575
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:52,119
Why isn't Liao Bufan here?

576
00:35:52,679 --> 00:35:53,519
Liao Bufan is on leave.

577
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:55,119
Liu Lang and I will coordinate this operation.

578
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:55,679
Okay.

579
00:35:55,679 --> 00:35:56,000
Chief Guo.

580
00:35:56,559 --> 00:35:56,840
Sit down.

581
00:35:58,840 --> 00:35:59,880
Everyone, sit down. Let's begin.

582
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:02,920
Comrades,

583
00:36:03,679 --> 00:36:04,360
this operation

584
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:06,039
is primarily to arrest

585
00:36:06,639 --> 00:36:08,159
the two foreign drug traffickers

586
00:36:08,639 --> 00:36:10,039
hiding in our Hongye City.

587
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:12,760
We must all work together sincerely

588
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:14,639
to ensure

589
00:36:15,079 --> 00:36:16,559
this operation goes flawlessly.

590
00:36:17,199 --> 00:36:19,000
The operation is led by Narcotics,

591
00:36:19,639 --> 00:36:20,519
with Comrade Zhang Peng

592
00:36:21,480 --> 00:36:23,199
serving as the general commander.

593
00:36:24,480 --> 00:36:27,320
Criminal Investigation and the Special Police Unit will assist,

594
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:29,960
and other units will coordinate accordingly.

595
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:31,760
Chief Zhang, please introduce

596
00:36:32,159 --> 00:36:33,800
the specific plan for this operation.

597
00:36:34,079 --> 00:36:34,400
Okay.

598
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,440
This is gonna be a big operation.

599
00:36:35,559 --> 00:36:35,920
Here's the situation.

600
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:37,679
We've acquired reliable intel

601
00:36:38,039 --> 00:36:39,000
that these two drug dealers

602
00:36:39,159 --> 00:36:41,360
will be at Xishan Pier tonight,

603
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,320
leaving Hongye by boat.

604
00:36:43,639 --> 00:36:45,480
For this arrest, we need to prepare

605
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:47,199
our cover and deployment in advance

606
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,800
to avoid alerting them

607
00:36:49,159 --> 00:36:50,159
and causing the mission to fail.

608
00:36:52,079 --> 00:36:55,039
So, we've chosen the west side of the pier.

609
00:36:55,599 --> 00:36:57,679
This area is relatively open.

610
00:36:58,559 --> 00:36:59,800
For the specific deployment,

611
00:37:00,039 --> 00:37:01,840
please refer to page two of the booklet.

612
00:37:04,679 --> 00:37:05,800
Let me emphasize,

613
00:37:07,159 --> 00:37:09,000
these two suspects

614
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:11,920
are also internationally wanted.

615
00:37:12,199 --> 00:37:13,239
They've committed multiple murders.

616
00:37:13,559 --> 00:37:14,599
And from what we understand,

617
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:16,519
they are highly likely

618
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,039
to be carrying firearms.

619
00:37:18,519 --> 00:37:19,679
They are extremely dangerous.

620
00:37:20,039 --> 00:37:21,039
Therefore, during the operation,

621
00:37:21,039 --> 00:37:21,920
we must be extremely cautious.

622
00:37:26,159 --> 00:37:29,320
These are the physical features of the two suspects.

623
00:37:30,039 --> 00:37:31,199
Suspect A,

624
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,119
nicknamed Shuahai.

625
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:35,360
He is around 1.8 meters tall,

626
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:36,559
with high cheekbones

627
00:37:37,079 --> 00:37:37,639
and curly hair.

628
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:39,159
Suspect B,

629
00:37:39,239 --> 00:37:41,119
around 1.82 meters tall,

630
00:37:41,119 --> 00:37:42,480
nicknamed Heihai.

631
00:37:42,679 --> 00:37:43,239
He wears glasses.

632
00:37:43,599 --> 00:37:44,840
His most defining feature

633
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:47,280
is right here on the base of his right thumb,

634
00:37:48,559 --> 00:37:49,559
where he has a black mole.

635
00:37:50,239 --> 00:37:50,960
Everyone, memorize this clearly.

636
00:37:51,719 --> 00:37:52,159
That's all.

637
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:56,719
Isn't this the guy we were investigating before?

638
00:38:02,159 --> 00:38:03,079
I also want to remind you,

639
00:38:04,039 --> 00:38:06,400
this operation must remain strictly confidential.

640
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:07,719
These two suspects

641
00:38:08,519 --> 00:38:09,760
are extremely vicious.

642
00:38:10,960 --> 00:38:13,199
We must ensure the safety of all our officers.

643
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:14,199
Understood.

644
00:38:14,599 --> 00:38:14,800
Yes, sir.

645
00:38:15,159 --> 00:38:15,360
Yes.

646
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:20,199
Do you need to go?

647
00:38:22,719 --> 00:38:24,000
The suspect you're looking for...

648
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:26,800
Wait for me in the car.

649
00:38:27,440 --> 00:38:27,679
Okay.

650
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:30,840
Is that the guy?

651
00:38:31,039 --> 00:38:31,800
Which guy?

652
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:35,239
The one who committed the murder in Luzhong?

653
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,079
As for this matter,

654
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,440
just keep it to yourself.

655
00:38:42,400 --> 00:38:44,000
Don't let the rest of the Special Police Unit know.

656
00:38:45,039 --> 00:38:45,519
Why?

657
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:48,280
Chief Guo gave specific orders.

658
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:49,480
He was even pounding the table the other day.

659
00:38:49,719 --> 00:38:51,679
We can't let the Special Police Unit know in advance.

660
00:38:52,039 --> 00:38:53,719
He's worried that during the mission,

661
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:54,840
they won't act with restraint.

662
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:56,400
Then they shouldn't have brought us here.

663
00:38:58,199 --> 00:38:59,079
What do you mean "us"?

664
00:38:59,519 --> 00:39:00,199
Are we them?

665
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:04,079
It's the Special Police Unit.

666
00:39:06,079 --> 00:39:06,840
Commissar Tan.

667
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:08,519
For the sake of the operation,

668
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:09,599
just bear with it.

669
00:39:12,159 --> 00:39:12,960
Stereotypes.

670
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:19,280
Old Tan,

671
00:39:19,960 --> 00:39:20,800
things are different now.

672
00:39:24,519 --> 00:39:24,880
Let's go.

673
00:39:38,119 --> 00:39:40,519
Aunt Chen, I'm not afraid of these anymore.

674
00:39:48,159 --> 00:39:50,639
Then let's play something even harder.

675
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:51,599
Are you up for the challenge?

676
00:39:54,639 --> 00:39:54,960
Come on.

677
00:39:58,559 --> 00:39:59,079
Give it another try.

678
00:40:20,159 --> 00:40:21,519
You're amazing.

679
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:24,239
Uncle Liao says I'm a man,

680
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,639
and I have to protect Mom.

681
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:27,079
You are a man.

682
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:33,440
Naonao's hearing sensitivity threshold

683
00:40:33,519 --> 00:40:34,639
has risen noticeably.

684
00:40:35,199 --> 00:40:37,280
His stress response to gunfire is basically gone,

685
00:40:38,079 --> 00:40:39,280
with no lasting aftereffects.

686
00:40:40,239 --> 00:40:40,960
But

687
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,800
we must avoid this happening again

688
00:40:42,880 --> 00:40:44,039
and triggering a second stress response.

689
00:40:44,840 --> 00:40:46,840
His personal condition has also improved.

690
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:49,320
He doesn't look away during eye contact now.

691
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,320
His attention is more focused than before,

692
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:53,519
and he's more cheerful now too.

693
00:40:56,239 --> 00:40:57,719
He quietly told me just now

694
00:40:58,480 --> 00:40:59,679
that he really likes Uncle Liao.

695
00:41:02,599 --> 00:41:03,239
That's right.

696
00:41:03,320 --> 00:41:04,719
Since Naonao met Chief Liao,

697
00:41:04,719 --> 00:41:06,320
he's become much more lively.

698
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:09,000
Chief Liao makes a pretty good dad.

699
00:41:09,119 --> 00:41:09,880
No, no, no.

700
00:41:10,639 --> 00:41:12,199
I haven't done anything special.

701
00:41:12,199 --> 00:41:14,159
I just take time to play with him.

702
00:41:14,519 --> 00:41:15,599
That's enough.

703
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:17,800
Filling the role of a father

704
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:19,559
is very important for Naonao.

705
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,840
So going forward,

706
00:41:27,599 --> 00:41:29,039
how do we reinforce this?

707
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,000
Keep playing with him more,

708
00:41:32,519 --> 00:41:33,960
and take him out to meet the world.

709
00:41:34,280 --> 00:41:35,920
Let him get used to noisy places,

710
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:38,079
and it'll lower his sensitivity to sound

711
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:39,440
so he won't be triggered as easily.

712
00:41:42,599 --> 00:41:42,880
All right.

713
00:41:43,159 --> 00:41:44,920
Thank you, Auntie Chen.

714
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:49,320
You thank someone without looking at them?

715
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,400
You just have to hug Uncle Liao, right?

716
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:53,679
Won't let go, huh?

717
00:41:54,480 --> 00:41:55,119
Up you go.

718
00:41:55,760 --> 00:41:56,400
Chief Ji.

719
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:57,599
Chief Liao.

720
00:41:58,199 --> 00:41:58,599
Chief Ji.

721
00:41:58,599 --> 00:41:59,119
Ms. Yuan.

722
00:41:59,639 --> 00:42:00,239
What a coincidence.

723
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:01,119
What are you doing here?

724
00:42:02,440 --> 00:42:03,519
Because of the hostage incident before,

725
00:42:03,519 --> 00:42:04,440
he was a little traumatized,

726
00:42:05,079 --> 00:42:06,280
so we came to Ms. Chen for counseling.

727
00:42:08,719 --> 00:42:09,800
You didn't tell me last time.

728
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:11,800
How's the child doing now?

729
00:42:12,920 --> 00:42:15,199
He's much better after Ms. Chen's counseling.

730
00:42:18,199 --> 00:42:19,280
I owe you an apology for that.

731
00:42:20,199 --> 00:42:21,480
That man is like a younger brother to me.

732
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:22,800
If he hadn't lost his mind,

733
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,880
the child wouldn't have been frightened.

734
00:42:24,400 --> 00:42:25,480
Please don't say that.

735
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:27,559
It wasn't your fault.

736
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:30,199
If I hadn't gone to replace my ID,

737
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:32,199
I wouldn't have run into that junkie.

738
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:33,800
It was just my bad luck.

739
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:35,239
All right.

740
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:38,159
If anything comes up, tell me.

741
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:39,119
Thank you.

742
00:42:39,559 --> 00:42:39,960
We're leaving.

743
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:41,760
Goodbye.

744
00:42:42,519 --> 00:42:43,519
Say goodbye to her.

745
00:42:44,119 --> 00:42:44,840
Goodbye.

746
00:42:47,039 --> 00:42:47,960
Still shy.

747
00:42:49,480 --> 00:42:51,599
Like a little girl. Be more confident.

748
00:42:51,599 --> 00:42:52,159
Goodbye.

749
00:42:53,039 --> 00:42:53,920
Thank you, Auntie Chen.

750
00:43:12,079 --> 00:43:15,199
I want to play in the ball pit and with the excavator.

751
00:43:15,199 --> 00:43:17,039
Jin Yonggang has been following Yuan Lai.

752
00:43:17,039 --> 00:43:18,320
So the kidnapping was no coincidence either.

753
00:43:19,119 --> 00:43:20,760
Tell him to bring the child back.

754
00:43:20,760 --> 00:43:22,599
We have to leave today.

755
00:43:22,599 --> 00:43:23,559
Mom.

756
00:43:23,559 --> 00:43:25,119
Why did only one guy show up?

757
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:26,440
Move in!

758
00:43:27,199 --> 00:43:28,159
Put your hands up!

759
00:43:33,239 --> 00:43:34,079
Get down!

760
00:43:34,079 --> 00:43:35,000
There's also a bomb!
